###1 Create car
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Skoda",
  "model": "Octavia",
  "year": 2025,
  "dailyPrice": 25000,
  "available": true
}

###2 Get all cars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars

###3 Get car by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1


###4 UPDATE car
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Audi",
  "model": "A6",
  "year": 2025,
  "dailyPrice": 30000,
  "available": false
}

###5 Delete car
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1

###6 Validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
"brand": "",
"model": "Camry",
"year": 2024,
"dailyPrice": -100,
"available": true
}

###7 Not found error
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/9999






### create a car in PostgreSQL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Mercedes",
  "model": "E63s",
  "year": 2022,
  "dailyPrice": 15000,
  "available": true
}

### first page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars?page=0&size=1

### second page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars?page=1&size=1

### persistence
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars?page=0&size=5

### update car
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "BMW",
  "model": "M5",
  "year": 2023,
  "dailyPrice": 30000,
  "available": true
}

### delete car
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1

### car not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/999

